    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d968">

                <pb facs="0991" n="871" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg871"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Foreign Affairs of
                            Norway to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-11-16"><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>United States consular representatives in Norway having been recognized by
                    Norwegian Government new exequaturs for these officers are not required.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Löveland.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
